I saw a few posts a while back regarding the Revo 5.1, but it looked as 
though nothing was ever done.  Right now, the card will produce really 
fuzzy sound using the current ice1724 driver.  I'm wondering how 
difficult it would be to get that driver to work properly with this 
card, and am willing to help however needed.  OSS has a driver for it, 
but it doesn't work overly well, and I'd rather use alsa.

